//
//  Secrets.example.xcconfig
//  AppTemplate
//
//  Template for Config/Secrets.xcconfig, which is gitignored. Copy this file,
//  drop the `.example`, and fill in real values.
//
//  Only client-side keys belong here — the kind a third-party SDK expects to
//  find in a shipped app. Everything in this file is substituted into
//  Info.plist and travels inside the IPA, so it keeps values out of git, not
//  off a user's device. Anything a service calls private or server-side stays
//  on your backend.
//
//  Each environment file already has `#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"`. The `?`
//  makes it optional, so a fresh clone builds without this file present.
//

DEV_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =
STAGING_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =
PROD_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =
